{"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Complex analytical and reasoning workflows are frequently error-prone when performed by a single monolithic model. Decomposing problems into specialized roles—such as ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Planner"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Analyst","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Critic","type":"text"}]},{"text":"—drastically improves reasoning accuracy, reduces hallucinations, and permits parallelized tool execution.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"SwiftAgent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" provides ","type":"text"},{"code":"MultiAgentOrchestrator","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"AgentMessageBus","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", a reactive multi-agent framework built on Swift’s structured concurrency primitives (","type":"text"},{"code":"AsyncStream","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"withTaskGroup","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Architectural-Topology","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Architectural Topology"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["                         ┌───────────────────────┐","                         │   User \/ Prompt Task  │","                         └───────────┬───────────┘","                                     │","                                     ▼","                       ┌───────────────────────────┐","                       │      AgentMessageBus      │","                       │       (AsyncStream)       │","                       └─────────────┬─────────────┘","                                     │ Broadcasts","         ┌───────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────┐","         ▼                           ▼                           ▼","┌──────────────────┐       ┌──────────────────┐       ┌──────────────────┐","│     Planner      │       │     Analyst      │       │      Critic      │","│ Decomposes steps │       │ Queries & Models │       │ Validates logic  │","└────────┬─────────┘       └────────┬─────────┘       └────────┬─────────┘","         │                          │                          │","         └──────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────┘","                                    │ Parallel Tool Calls","                                    ▼","                     ┌─────────────────────────────┐","                     │ MultiAgentOrchestrator      │","                     │ withTaskGroup Tool Executor │","                     └──────────────┬──────────────┘","                                    │","               ┌────────────────────┴────────────────────┐","               ▼                                         ▼","      DataFrame Query Tool                      Statistical Model Tool"]},{"anchor":"Parallel-Tool-Calling","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Parallel Tool Calling"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When an agent requests multiple tool executions in a single reasoning step (e.g. computing standard deviations across three columns concurrently), ","type":"text"},{"code":"MultiAgentOrchestrator.executeToolsInParallel(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" executes them simultaneously across available CPU cores using ","type":"text"},{"code":"withTaskGroup","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This reduces total latency from $\\sum_{i=1}^M T_i$ to $\\max_{i} T_i$.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Example-Usage","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Example Usage"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import SwiftAgent","import SwiftDataFrame","","\/\/ 1. Initialize orchestrator and message bus","let orchestrator = MultiAgentOrchestrator(maxRounds: 5)","","\/\/ 2. Register specialized agents","orchestrator.registerAgent(PlannerAgent())","orchestrator.registerAgent(DataAnalystAgent())","orchestrator.registerAgent(CriticAgent())","","\/\/ 3. Register tools","orchestrator.registerTool(DataFrameAgentTool(dataframe: salesData))","","\/\/ 4. Run collaborative execution","let solution = try await orchestrator.run(","    taskPrompt: \"Identify top 3 departments by salary variance and critique findings.\"",")","print(\"Consensus Answer: \\(solution)\")"]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/MultiAgentCollaboration"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"API Collection","modules":[{"name":"SwiftAgent"}],"role":"collectionGroup","title":"Multi-Agent Coordination & Protocols"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Multi-Agent Coordination","anchor":"Multi-Agent-Coordination","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/MultiAgentOrchestrator","doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/AgentMessageBus","doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/AgentMessage","doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/AgentToolCall","doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/AgentToolResult","doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/SpecializedAgent"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent"]]},"kind":"article","seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Guides & Tutorials","anchor":"Guides--Tutorials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/AgenticReplAndRAG"]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftagent\/multiagentcollaboration"]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Orchestrate teams of specialized autonomous agents over an asynchronous message bus with concurrent parallel tool calling.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://SwiftAgent/documentation/SwiftAgent":{"url":"\/documentation\/swiftagent","abs